  effect: when getting a kill, get a stack of killstreak. these stacks last for 3
    seconds and can stack endlessly with the buff duration being reset every new
    stack. when you lose a stack of killstreak, you lose all of them at once, generating
    a fire pulse centered from you that does big damage, and burns enemies in a large
    radias. The fire pulse is enhanced with every stack of killstreak consumed. Each
    stack of this item buffs the explosion further
